## The project

A student entrepreneurship blog built on Webflow, with articles for young entrepreneurs and students. It started in early 2022 with a brand built from scratch, inspired by the book *WTF con el SAT*, which explains tax and accounting topics in a fresh, fun way. The blog feeds its social channels through Meta Business Suite.

{% figure src="/images/projects/emprendete/devices.png" alt="Empréndete blog on desktop and mobile" wide=true /%}

## Main challenges

- Site architecture and sitemap.
- Mobile-first navigation.
- UX writing.
- Managing Webflow and setting up the CMS to keep content under control.
